    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This grid puzzle game is perfect for relaxing during your leisure time. The gameplay is simple and intuitive: move the puzzle pieces based on the reference image on the right, and try to restore it to the complete picture. Each level presents a challenge, but it never feels overwhelming because there is no time limit, allowing you to enjoy the puzzle at a leisurely pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unlocks 30 levels right from the start, and the gradually increasing difficulty along with ever-changing image styles ensure that every time you play, you feel a fresh sense of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its beautiful interface design and smooth gameplay experience, this game is the ideal choice to unwind and pass the time. Give it a try!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This grid puzzle game is perfect for relaxing during your leisure time. The gameplay is simple and intuitive: move the puzzle pieces based on the reference image on the right, and try to restore it to the complete picture. Each level presents a challenge, but it never feels overwhelming because there is no time limit, allowing you to enjoy the puzzle at a leisurely pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unlocks 30 levels right from the start, and the gradually increasing difficulty along with ever-changing image styles ensure that every time you play, you feel a fresh sense of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its beautiful interface design and smooth gameplay experience, this game is the ideal choice to unwind and pass the time. Give it a try!</p></li></ul>",
